    d: { q: 'Which part of the text carries the main point?', o: ['"archaeologists interpreted the large stone enclosures ... as ceremonial spaces"', '"the scarcity of such remains may reflect cleaning practices rather than function," backed by the soil evidence', '"microscopic charred grain"'], a: 1, why: 'The ceremonial reading is the old view and the grain is one piece of evidence; Demir\'s reinterpretation is the main point.' },
